# Project TITAN Workspace Design Principle V1.0

**Status:** PM Final Approval 2026-07-08 Sprint 11

**Code SSoT:** `src/config/titanWorkspaceDesignPrinciple.js` `TITAN_WORKSPACE_HOME_PRINCIPLE`

**Reference:** `src/config/companyWorkspaceArchitecture.js` `src/pages/Company/CompanyDashboardPage.jsx`

---

## Core Principle

**Workspace Home = Launcher-only entrance.** Users pick a task card and go directly to work.

---

## Official Structure (all Workspaces)

```text
Workspace Home -> Quick Launcher -> Section Page -> Dashboard -> KPI -> Search -> List -> CRUD
```

| Layer | Role |
|---|---|
| **Workspace Home** | Big Launcher cards only |
| **Quick Launcher** | Task area cards (4x2 or 2x4 grid) |
| **Section Page** | Route shell with title |
| **Dashboard** | Section content / summary |
| **KPI** | Section metrics (same data as list) |
| **Search** | TitanSearchPanel Live Search |
| **List** | TitanDataTable list-first |
| **CRUD** | Register Edit Delete |

---

## Workspace Home Rules

### Home must ONLY have

- Minimal header (kicker + title)
- Workspace Nav
- Big Launcher cards (equal size, strong hover, icon scale)

### Home must NOT have

- Charts Tables Long descriptions
- CRUD KPI Summary Company Summary
- Business Site cards Recent Activity
- Dashboard widgets Search List

**Long intro:** Hide `workspaceIntro` on Home route only. Show on section routes.

---

## Section Page Shell (Sprint 11 placeholder only)

