## Launcher Card UX

- Grid 4x2 or 2x4 equal-size cards
- Card: icon badge title concise description
- Hover shadow translateY icon scale
- No separate go button - whole card clickable

---

## Cursor Do

- Check this rule and `TITAN_WORKSPACE_HOME_PRINCIPLE` before Workspace Home changes
- Keep Home launcher-only
- Section pages use shell placeholders until Sprint CRUD
- Use Company Workspace as reference for new workspaces

## Cursor Do Not

- Put KPI Summary Activity Table on Workspace Home
- Show long intro on Home
- Implement CRUD before section Sprint
- Design different Home layouts per workspace

